"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOf6bZEhKO_childItem_5","label":"ggOf6bZEhKO_childItem_5","default":"<p>Can I take GemGut with other supplements?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaEh6p6QMd_text","label":"ggaEh6p6QMd_text","default":"<p>GemGut is a daily gut health supplement designed to support digestion, reduce bloating, and improve gut balance — especially for people dealing with stress-related digestive issues.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4BPcGcAE-_text","label":"gg4BPcGcAE-_text","default":"<p>Most probiotics only focus on adding good bacteria. GemGut goes further by combining probiotics, digestive enzymes, and soothing extracts to support both immediate relief and long-term gut health.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNEj4B5uFJ_text","label":"ggNEj4B5uFJ_text","default":"<p>Take 1–2 servings daily, preferably after meals. No preparation needed — designed for convenience.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg55veKo_hY_text","label":"gg55veKo_hY_text","default":"<p>Many users notice reduced bloating and discomfort within 30–60 minutes, with more stable digestion over consistent use.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggowdtGS-B3_text","label":"ggowdtGS-B3_text","default":"<p>Yes. GemGut is non-habit forming and designed to be part of your daily routine.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdIfsiW9mO_text","label":"ggdIfsiW9mO_text","default":"<p>In most cases, yes. However, if you’re on medication or have specific conditions, consult your healthcare provider. For best results, consistent daily use helps maintain a balanced gut microbiome and prevent recurring issues.</p>"}],
